<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12061] Silently fail while try to recreate already existing index with differ inline_size.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12061</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;INLINE_SIZE differ from previous value is  not correctly sets.&lt;br/&gt;
1. create index idx0(c1, c2)&lt;br/&gt;
2. drop idx0&lt;br/&gt;
3. create index idx0(c1, c2) inline_size 100;&lt;br/&gt;
inline_size remains the same, in this case default = 10.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
